Synthesis script files
======================

Top level, Vic, synthesis files
-------------------------------
Vic.cmd : Top level synthesis command file
Vic.scr : Top level constraints file
Vic_exceptions.scr : Top level exceptions file
Vic_scan.cmd : Top level scan insertion file

